#: krdc.cpp:127 krdc.cpp:159
msgid "The entered host does not have the required form."
msgstr "Uneseno ime računara nema zahtjevanu formu."

#: krdc.cpp:128 krdc.cpp:160
msgid "Malformed URL or host"
msgstr "Pogrešan URL ili ime računara"

#: krdc.cpp:188
msgid "%1 - Remote Desktop Connection"
msgstr "%1 - Konekcija na udaljeni Desktop"

#: krdc.cpp:202
msgid ""
"Here you can see the remote desktop. If the other side allows you to control "
"it, you can also move the mouse, click or enter keystrokes. If the content "
"does not fit your screen, click on the toolbar's full screen button or scale "
"button. To end the connection, just close the window."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete vidjeti udaljeni desktop. Ako korisnik na udaljenom desktopu omogući kontrolu, "
"moći ćete takođe pomjerati pokazivač, kliknuti na ikonu ili unijeti podatak sa tastature. Ako se sadržaj ne uklapa na "
"vašem ekranu, kliknite na dugme za citav ekran na traci sa alatima. Za završetak konekcije, samo zatvori prozor."

#: krdc.cpp:238
msgid "Establishing connection..."
msgstr "Ostvarenje konekcije..."

#: krdc.cpp:244
msgid "Authenticating..."
msgstr "Provjeravanje..."

#: krdc.cpp:249
msgid "Preparing desktop..."
msgstr "Priprema desktopa..."

#: main.cpp:34 main.cpp:64 rc.cpp:18
msgid "Remote Desktop Connection"
msgstr "Konekcija na udaljeni desktop"

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "Start in fullscreen mode."
msgstr "Početak u kompletno vidljivom ekranu "

#: main.cpp:42
msgid "Start in regular window."
msgstr "Početak u regularnom prozoru."

#: main.cpp:44
msgid "Low quality mode (Tight Encoding, 8 bit color)."
msgstr "Mod niskog kvaliteta (usko kodiranje, 8 bitna boja)"

#: main.cpp:46
msgid "Medium quality mode (Tight Encoding, lossy)."
msgstr "Mod srednjeg kvaliteta (usko kodiranje)"

#: main.cpp:48
msgid "High quality mode, default (Hextile Encoding)."
msgstr "Mod visoke kvalitete, uobičajeno (hextile kodiranje)"

#: main.cpp:50
msgid "Override VNC encoding list (e.g. 'hextile raw')."
msgstr "Zanemari VNC liste kodiranja (npr. 'hextile raw')."

#: main.cpp:52
msgid "Provide the password in a file."
msgstr "Obezbijedi šifru u datoteci."

#: main.cpp:54
msgid "Resolution of the remote desktop."
msgstr "Rezolucija udaljenog desktopa."

#: main.cpp:56
msgid "Keyboard layout on Terminal Server."
msgstr "Izgled tastature na Terminal Serveru."

#: main.cpp:57
msgid "The name of the host, e.g. 'localhost:1'."
msgstr "Ime računara, npr. 'localhost:1'."

#: main.cpp:75
msgid "RDP backend"
msgstr "RDP backend"

#: main.cpp:77
msgid "Original VNC viewer and protocol design"
msgstr "Original VNC preglednik i protokol dizajn"

#: main.cpp:79
msgid "TightVNC encoding"
msgstr "TightVNC kodiranje"

#: main.cpp:81
msgid "ZLib encoding"
msgstr "ZLib kodiranje"

#: main.cpp:120
msgid "The password file '%1' does not exist."
msgstr "Datoteka šifri '%1' ne postoji."

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "FullScreen Toolbar"
msgstr "ČitavEkran Traka sa alatima"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Autohide on/off"
msgstr "AutoSakrivanje on/off"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Fullscreen off"
msgstr "Čitav Ekran isključen"

#: rc.cpp:7 rc.cpp:51
msgid "Scale Content"
msgstr "Sadržaj ljestvice"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "@cookie:0"
msgstr "@cookie:0"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Minimize"
msgstr "Minimiziraj"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Enter Key Combination"
msgstr "Unesi kombinaciju tastera"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Enter a special key or key combination to send to the remote side:"
msgstr "Unesi specijalni taster ili kombinaciju tastera za slanje na udaljenu stranu:"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"This function allows you to send a key combination like Ctrl-Alt-Del to the "
"remote side. Press Esc to cancel."
msgstr "Ova funkcija omogućava da pošalješ kombinaciju tastera Ctrl-Alt-Del na udaljenu stranu. Pritisni Esc za prekid."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Rescan"
msgstr "&Rescan"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid ""
"Rescans the network. Depending on the network configuration this may take a "
"few seconds until all systems have responded."
msgstr "Ponovi pretraživanje mreže. U zavisnosti od mrežne postavke pretraživanje može potrajati nekoliko sekundi dok svi sistemi odgovore."

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Search:"
msgstr "&Traži:"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Enter a search term"
msgstr "Unesi traženi pojam"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid ""
"Enter a search term here if you want to search for a specific system, then "
"press Enter or click Rescan. All systems, whose description matchs the "
"search term, will be displayed. The search is not case sensitive. If you "
"leave the field empty all systems will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesi traženi pojam ako želiš da pretražuješ specifični sistem, onda pritisni Enter ili klikni na Rescan. Svi sistemi, čiji "
"opis odogovara specifičnim pojmovima, će biti prikazani. Pretraživanje nije osjetljivo na veličinu slova. Ako ostaviš polje prazno "
"svi sistemi će biti prikazani."

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Sco&pe:"
msgstr "Sco&pe:"

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid ""
"An administrator can configure the network to have several scopes. If this "
"is the case, you can select the scope to scan here."
msgstr "Administrator može podesiti mrežu da ima više opsega- Ako je to slučaj, možeš odabrati opseg pregleda. "

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ime"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Vrsta"

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adresa"

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Here you can see the systems on the network that allow you to connect. Note "
"that an administrator can hide systems, so the list is not always complete. "
"Click on an item to select it, double-click it to connect immediately."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možeš vidjeti sisteme na mreži koji ti daju mogućnost povezivanja. Adminstrator može sakriti sisteme, tako da lista nije uvijek "
"kompletna. Klikni na stavku da bi je oznacio, uradi dvostruki klik da bi se odmah povezao."

#: rc.cpp:31
msgid "Remote &desktop:"
msgstr "Udaljeni &desktop"

#: rc.cpp:32
msgid "Enter the name and display number"
msgstr "Unesi ime i prikaži broj"

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid ""
"Enter the name and display number of the computer that you want to connect "
"to, separated by a colon, e.g. 'mycomputer:1'. The address can be any valid "
"Internet address. The display numbers usually start at 0. If you do not have "
"a display number, try 0 or 1.\n"
"Remote Desktop Connection only supports systems that use VNC."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "&Browse <<"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Turn on/off the network browsing panel."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Enter the address and display number of the computer that you want to "
"connect to, separated by a colon. Alternatively, browse the network and "
"select a desktop to connect to. All VNC or RDP compatible servers will be "
"supported."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "Connection &type:"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid "High Quality (LAN, direct connection)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Medium Quality (DSL, Cable, fast Internet)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:40
msgid "Low Quality (Modem, ISDN, slow Internet)"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:41
msgid ""
"Use this to specify the performance of your connection. Note that you should "
"select the speed of the weakest link - even if you have a high speed "
"connection this will not help you if the remote computer uses a slow modem. "
"Choosing a too high quality on a slow link will cause slower response times. "
"Choosing a lower quality will increase latencies in high speed connections "
"and results in lower image quality, especially in 'Low Quality' mode."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "C&onnect"
msgstr ""

